  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
     {"\"the two channels have the same bubble B, and B is the pp bubble\"", 
      "\[Rule]", "True"}]], "Output"], Cell["Compare with the note: P(t) = (t \
+ a^2)^2 - a^2 b^2 = (t - t+)(t - t-), t+- = -a^2 +- a b, G(t) = t + a rho b \
+ a^2 rho^2, As = a rho b + a^2 (1 - 8 p1), B = -beta/2 G(t)/P(t), L_t = \
-beta/2 (t + a rho b + a^2)/P(t), L_s = beta/2 (t + As)/P(t).", "Text"], 
  Cell[BoxData[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"tp", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"a", "^", "2"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
