  Cell["Residue rule (Lemma \"residue rule\"): for a proper rational phi \
without poles on the lattice, Sum_n phi(z_n) = Sum over poles y of Res_(t = \
y) phi(t) S_k(t). resS gives the residue at one pole y of order m, given the \
value s0 = S_k(y).", "Text"], 
  Cell[BoxData[
    {RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"resS", "[", RowBox[{"phi_", ",", " ", 
               "t_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "m_", ",", " ", "s0_"}], 
             "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
             RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", "d", "}"}], ",", " ", RowBox[
                {"Coefficient", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
                     RowBox[{"Normal", "[", RowBox[{"Series", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"phi", " ", "/.", 
                          " ", RowBox[{"t", " ", "->", " ", RowBox[{"y", " ", 
