  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0.501469`", ",", "Null"}], "}"}]], 
   "Output"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"\"Step 3, Eq. (mode-image)\"", "\[Rule]", 
      "True"}]], "Output"], Cell["6.5 Step 4: solving and reading off Gamma", 
   "Subsection"], Cell["By Steps 1-3, P(z) chi_r maps D_v delta + E_v/(z + v) \
to P(v) delta_(z v) + (1/beta)[-N2(z) + lambda rho z (F(v) - 1) + lambda W(z; \
v^2)/e(v)], the constant 2 eps a/beta^2 to N2(z)/beta (Step 2), and phi_j/K_j \
to -beta [z + W(z; s_j)/(rho P(u_j))]. P - e is even of degree two and W is \
of degree one in s, so with e(v) = (v^2 - s1)(v^2 - s2) partial fractions \
give F(v) - 1 = Sum_j F_j g_j(v) and W(z; v^2)/e(v) = Sum_j W(z; s_j)/(s_j - \
s_l) g_j(v), with F_j = P(u_j)/(s_j - s_l):", "Text"], 
  Cell[BoxData[{RowBox[{"check", "[", RowBox[{"\"P - e is A v^2 + B\"", ",", 
