   "Output"], Cell["So the column y_v(z) = D_v delta + E_v/(z + v) + \
(1/beta^2)[2 eps a + lambda rho Sum_j F_j g_j(v) phi_j(z)/K_j] solves P chi \
y_v = P(v) delta_(z v): the terms of Step 1, Step 2 and Step 3 cancel \
pairwise. With phi_j(z) = (K_j z + u_j [beta H(-u_j) - lambda alpha_j])/(z^2 \
- s_j) and the identity F(z) - F(v) = -(z^2 - v^2) Sum_j F_j g_j(z) g_j(v):", 
   "Text"], 
  Cell[BoxData[
    {RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"gj", "[", RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "sj_"}], 
