  Cell["Hence, with DD(z, v) = (z F(z) - v F(v))/(z^2 - v^2) = F(v)/(z + v) - \
z Sum_j F_j g_j(z) g_j(v) and gamma_j = lambda rho Z_j/(s_j - s_l), Z_j = u_j \
P(u_j) [beta H(-u_j) - lambda alpha_j]/K_j,\ny_v(z) = D_v delta_(z v) + \
