  Cell["A genuine divergence: at mu = 0, d channel, k = 0, n = 0, the \
condition beta H(z_0) = -lambda h reads 3 (beta a)^2 = pi^2 (as p0 + p1 = \
1/2), i.e. beta U = 2 pi/sqrt(3). There the mirror-odd vector e_0 - e_(-1) is \
a null vector of chi_d, on every finite box:", "Text"], 
